{"1014580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RB: Axolotl", "steam_appid": 1014580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking place in a tank suspended upon a cosmic wonderland, five axolotls appear one day from a mysterious, thundering void. They quickly learn they are able to speak with one another, and relationships are formed. However, something is off. Each axolotl seems to possess knowledge they should not know. Foods, and people, and places and concepts...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And obsessions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid conspiracies, illnesses, fights to the death, VR headsets, and bizarre reality switching, a figure named [RB] seems to be pulling the strings behind it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/extras/11949d499221b5cb2603e1ecd64de5ed.poster.avif?t=1741111077\" width=552 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/extras/11949d499221b5cb2603e1ecd64de5ed.webm?t=1741111077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/extras/11949d499221b5cb2603e1ecd64de5ed.mp4?t=1741111077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Variety is the spice of life, and with RB: Axolotl you never know what to expect! There are more realities out there than just the tank...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Press ‘S’ at various points in the story to perform the world's greatest somersault!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•A meticulously crafted universe full of lore, rewarding detail-oriented players. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Dynamic movements bursting with personality! Each animation is handcrafted with care and love, and no scene looks the same.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Plot twists, revelations, and hefty battle scenes are in store for those who take their first steps into the tank.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•A catchy OST by a variety of artists.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Written and programmed by one individual. A true passion project.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an emotional tale that I built with all the passion and love in my heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite its cute art style,<strong> the visual novel RB: Axolotl is intended for mature audiences only.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/extras/c9eb42fa1402e889204e67a283d2f5a0.avif?t=1741111077\" width=300 height=243 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking place in a tank suspended upon a cosmic wonderland, five axolotls appear one day from a mysterious, thundering void. They quickly learn they are able to speak with one another, and relationships are formed. However, something is off. Each axolotl seems to possess knowledge they should not know. Foods, and people, and places and concepts...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And obsessions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid conspiracies, illnesses, fights to the death, VR headsets, and bizarre reality switching, a figure named [RB] seems to be pulling the strings behind it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/extras/11949d499221b5cb2603e1ecd64de5ed.poster.avif?t=1741111077\" width=552 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/extras/11949d499221b5cb2603e1ecd64de5ed.webm?t=1741111077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/extras/11949d499221b5cb2603e1ecd64de5ed.mp4?t=1741111077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Variety is the spice of life, and with RB: Axolotl you never know what to expect! There are more realities out there than just the tank...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Press ‘S’ at various points in the story to perform the world's greatest somersault!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•A meticulously crafted universe full of lore, rewarding detail-oriented players. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Dynamic movements bursting with personality! Each animation is handcrafted with care and love, and no scene looks the same.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Plot twists, revelations, and hefty battle scenes are in store for those who take their first steps into the tank.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•A catchy OST by a variety of artists.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Written and programmed by one individual. A true passion project.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an emotional tale that I built with all the passion and love in my heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite its cute art style,<strong> the visual novel RB: Axolotl is intended for mature audiences only.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/extras/c9eb42fa1402e889204e67a283d2f5a0.avif?t=1741111077\" width=300 height=243 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Five axolotls appear one day through a void, their entire existence shrouded in mystery. A suspenseful tale, dripping with humor and full of surprises, lined by an underlying emotional theme that will strike a chord with just about anyone.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“...RB: Axolotl is definitely a must-play for those who are looking for something refreshing in the visual novel's genre and managed to utterly surprise me, wishing the story of Axy and his friends wasn't already over.”<br>TentacleBunny's Cozy Cottage<br><br>“When it comes to mysteries, a few shocks are always welcome.”<br>Save Or Quit<br><br>“VNs like RB: Axolotl are precious gems that I am so glad I exist. And are the reason that VNs as a genre are amazing...”<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/header.jpg?t=1741111077", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741111077", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741111077", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP, Vista, 7, 8, or 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128 mb<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128 mb<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Actawesome"], "publishers": ["Actawesome"], "demos": [{"appid": 1025720, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$9.99"}, "packages": [336226], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy RB: Axolotl", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 336226, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "RB: Axolotl - $9.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 999}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014580/ss_111aa029b2fc22db95a4366ff7fb9835417cad95.600x338.jpg?t=1741111077", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/10